awapan</div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">F1</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Membawa kes Malayan Union ke Mahkamah Tinggi England</strong></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H1a</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Persidangan Raja-raja Melayu di Istana Iskandariah Kuala Kangsar</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H1b</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Sultan Perak, Sultan Kedah dan Sultan Johor akan berangkat ke England sekiranya kehendiran mereka diperlukan di mahkamah tersebut.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">F2</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Menghantar surat bantahan ke London</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H2a</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Sultan Kedah, Perak dan Johor mengutus surat bantahan kepada Setiausaha Tanah Jajahan British, George Henry Hall</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H2b</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail mengirim telegram kepada kerajaan British di London.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H3</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Menyokong Kongres Melayu</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\"></span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Sultan Hisamuddin Alam Shah ibni Almarhum Sultan Alauddin Sulaiman Shah menderma sebanyak $15 ribu kepada Persatuan Melayu Selangor.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">F4</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Permaisuri Perak memimpin Gerakan menentang Malayan Union</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H4</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Tuanku Permaisuri Perak, Raja Perempuan Kelsom mengetahui barisan hadapan perarakan.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">F5</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Memulau upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H5</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Dato' Onn Jaafar mempersembahkan resolusi Kongres Melayu, memohon Raja-raja Melayu supaya bersama-sama dengan rakyat memboikot upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union.</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"answer-item\" style=\"margin-top: 14px;\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">F6</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\"><strong>Menggunakan akhbar</strong></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H6a</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">menyeru orang Melayu mengadakan perhimpunan besar besaran.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">H6b</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">sentiasa melaporkan perkembangan berita penentangan orang Melayu.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"answer-item\">\n        <span class=\"answer-label\">C6</span>\n        <span class=\"answer-text\">Utusan Melayu, Majlis, Warta Negara</span>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
